<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ssh on 潘达窝</title><link>https://daidaij.github.io/tags/ssh/</link><description>Ssh 的订阅 — 潘达窝</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>pandazhangs</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:33:10 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://daidaij.github.io/tags/ssh/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>轻量服务器加固实践：五层防线与零新增组件</title><link>https://daidaij.github.io/p/lightweight-server-hardening/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:33:10 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://daidaij.github.io/p/lightweight-server-hardening/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/02bb8459/800/600" alt="Featured image of post 轻量服务器加固实践：五层防线与零新增组件" />&lt;h1 id="轻量服务器加固实践五层防线与零新增组件">轻量服务器加固实践：五层防线与零新增组件
&lt;/h1>&lt;hr>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>一台 2C2G 的腾讯云 Debian 13，公网开着 22 端口，定位是&amp;quot;只部署不构建&amp;quot;。两轮加固做下来，新增软件包数量是零，全部改动落在配置层和系统能力上。这篇记录完整的加固清单、几个选型判断，以及两处翻车。&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://daidaij.github.io/images/hardening-practice/hero-layers.png"
loading="lazy"
alt="轻量服务器的五层防线"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="先审计再动手">先审计，再动手
&lt;/h2>&lt;hr>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>加固前先搞清楚机器暴露了什么、跑了什么，不然就是在别人的清单上抄作业。&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>审计就这几条命令，十分钟出结果：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ss -tlnp &lt;span class="c1"># 谁在监听&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">systemctl list-units --type&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>service --state&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>running
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sshd -T &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> grep -E &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;permitroot|password|maxauth&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1"># sshd 实际生效配置&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">nft list ruleset &lt;span class="c1"># 防火墙现状&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">last -n &lt;span class="m">10&lt;/span> -F &lt;span class="c1"># 谁登录过&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt list --upgradable &lt;span class="c1"># 有没有欠账的补丁&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这台机器当时的状态：全机只有 sshd 的 22 在监听，fail2ban、chrony、unattended-upgrades 都在跑，OpenSSH 是 10.0p2，无待升级包。之前做过一轮 CIS 风格加固（sysctl、nftables、sshd drop-in），所以这次做的是增量，不是从零开始。&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>小机器的好消息是攻击面天然小：没有 web 应用、没有数据库、没有容器运行时，自动化扫描脚本最爱的 RCE 入口一个都没有。&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="入口层nftables-默认-drop">入口层：nftables 默认 DROP
&lt;/h2>&lt;hr>
&lt;p>&lt;code>/etc/nftables.conf&lt;/code> 的 input 链，策略默认拒绝，逐条放行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">21
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">22
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">23
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">table inet filter {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> chain input {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> type filter hook input priority filter; policy drop;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> iif lo accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ct state established,related accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ct state invalid drop
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> # DHCP / DHCPv6 client: lease replies must be able to come back
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> udp dport 68 accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> udp dport 546 accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> # ICMP / ICMPv6: path-MTU discovery, neighbour discovery, diagnostics
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ip protocol icmp accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ip6 nexthdr icmpv6 accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> # SSH
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> tcp dport 22 accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> # LLM API distribution service (Go)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> tcp dport 8338 accept
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>几个细节：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>ct state established,related accept&lt;/code> 放最前面，回包不走后面整条规则链&lt;/li>
&lt;li>DHCP 的 68/546 必须放行，云主机靠它续租 IP&lt;/li>
&lt;li>ICMP 放行是为了 PMTU discovery 和邻居发现，全禁 ICMP 是老直觉，不是好实践&lt;/li>
&lt;li>8338 是留给后续 API 服务的口，端口先放行，服务没上线前外面也摸不到东西&lt;/li>
&lt;li>fail2ban 的 f2b-table 是单独一张表，这份配置不碰它，reload 互不影响&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>云厂商的安全组是另一道免费防线——把 22 收紧到常用 IP 段，扫描脚本连握手的机会都没有，零主机成本。这道做在控制台上，不在机器里。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="认证层sshd-只认密钥">认证层：sshd 只认密钥
&lt;/h2>&lt;hr>
&lt;p>Debian 13 的 sshd 支持 drop-in，全部加固集中在 &lt;code>/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-hardening.conf&lt;/code>：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">21
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">22
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">23
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">24
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">25
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">26
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">27
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">28
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">29
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">30
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">31
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PubkeyAuthentication yes
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PasswordAuthentication no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">AuthenticationMethods publickey
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PermitEmptyPasswords no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">AllowUsers root
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">MaxAuthTries 3
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">MaxSessions 4
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">MaxStartups 3:50:10
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">LoginGraceTime 30
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">X11Forwarding no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">AllowAgentForwarding no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">AllowTcpForwarding no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PermitTunnel no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PermitUserEnvironment no
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">LogLevel VERBOSE
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ClientAliveInterval 300
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ClientAliveCountMax 3
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># --- algorithm restriction: ssh-audit Debian 13 Server hardening guide ---
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">KexAlgorithms mlkem768x25519-sha256,sntrup761x25519-sha512,sntrup761x25519-sha512@openssh.com,curve25519-sha256,curve25519-sha256@libssh.org
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Ciphers chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com,aes256-gcm@openssh.com,aes256-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes128-gcm@openssh.com,aes128-ctr
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">MACs hmac-sha2-512-etm@openssh.com,hmac-sha2-256-etm@openssh.com,umac-128-etm@openssh.com
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">HostKeyAlgorithms sk-ssh-ed25519-cert-v01@openssh.com,ssh-ed25519-cert-v01@openssh.com,rsa-sha2-512-cert-v01@openssh.com,rsa-sha2-256-cert-v01@openssh.com,sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com,ssh-ed25519,rsa-sha2-512,rsa-sha2-256
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms sk-ssh-ed25519-cert-v01@openssh.com,ssh-ed25519-cert-v01@openssh.com,rsa-sha2-512-cert-v01@openssh.com,rsa-sha2-256-cert-v01@openssh.com,sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com,ssh-ed25519,rsa-sha2-512,rsa-sha2-256
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RequiredRSASize 3072
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># --- audit: log sftp file access (Mozilla OpenSSH guidelines) ---
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server -f AUTHPRIV -l INFO
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>几个关键选择：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>AllowUsers root&lt;/code> 显式白名单，以后新增的账户默认进不来，要进再加&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>AuthenticationMethods publickey&lt;/code> 加 &lt;code>PasswordAuthentication no&lt;/code>：撞库字典直接作废&lt;/li>
&lt;li>算法白名单照 ssh-audit 的 Debian 13 指南抄，KEX 首选 mlkem768x25519（后量子混合）&lt;/li>
&lt;li>转发类五连关：X11 / Agent / TCP / Tunnel / StreamLocal——机器只当部署目标，没有转发需求&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>MaxStartups 3:50:10&lt;/code> 很激进：3 个未认证连接就开始 50% 概率丢弃，10 个全丢。单管理员机器够用&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="防爆破sshd-100-已经内置了一套">防爆破：sshd 10.0 已经内置了一套
&lt;/h2>&lt;hr>
&lt;p>这次调研最大的意外：OpenSSH 9.8 起 PerSourcePenalties &lt;strong>默认开启&lt;/strong>，官方定位就是&amp;quot;内置的 fail2ban 替代&amp;quot;。也就是说大多数跑着新 OpenSSH 的机器上，其实同时跑着两套防爆破，管理员自己不知道。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>内置惩罚的默认值（&lt;code>man 5 sshd_config&lt;/code>）：&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>触发条件&lt;/th>
&lt;th>惩罚&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>认证失败后断开&lt;/td>
&lt;td>5 秒&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>LoginGraceTime 内没完成认证&lt;/td>
&lt;td>10 秒&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>把 sshd 弄崩&lt;/td>
&lt;td>90 秒&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>单源累计上限&lt;/td>
&lt;td>10 分钟&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>起罚门槛（累计到才生效）&lt;/td>
&lt;td>15 秒&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>按 &lt;code>PerSourceNetBlockSize 32:128&lt;/code> 逐 IP 追踪，不连坐 NAT 邻居；10.0 又加了 PerSourceMaxStartups 限制单源未认证并发。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>fail2ban 留着做双轨：它封在 nftables 层，TCP 握手前就掐掉；sshd 内置惩罚在进程内生效，不依赖任何外部进程。配置薄到只有几行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/defaults-debian.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[DEFAULT]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">banaction = nftables
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">banaction_allports = nftables[type=allports]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[sshd]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">backend = systemd
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">journalmatch = _SYSTEMD_UNIT=ssh.service + _COMM=sshd
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">enabled = true
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/99-tune.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[sshd]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">bantime = 1h
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">findtime = 30m
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>选型对比（2G 内存视角）：&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>方案&lt;/th>
&lt;th>常驻内存&lt;/th>
&lt;th>防线位置&lt;/th>
&lt;th>结论&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>OpenSSH 内置惩罚&lt;/td>
&lt;td>0&lt;/td>
&lt;td>sshd 进程内&lt;/td>
&lt;td>已默认开启&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>fail2ban&lt;/td>
&lt;td>实测 31 MB&lt;/td>
&lt;td>nftables 封禁集合&lt;/td>
&lt;td>保留，纵深冗余&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>sshguard&lt;/td>
&lt;td>约 2 MB（社区数据）&lt;/td>
&lt;td>nftables&lt;/td>
&lt;td>够轻，但没有换的必要&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>CrowdSec&lt;/td>
&lt;td>约 77 MB（官方论坛实测）&lt;/td>
&lt;td>社区情报联动&lt;/td>
&lt;td>2G 机器不装&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>31 MB 买一道握手前的拦截，值；为省这 31 MB 去折腾组件替换，不值。&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="内核层把提权原语直接砍掉">内核层：把提权原语直接砍掉
&lt;/h2>&lt;hr>
&lt;p>sysctl 集中在 &lt;code>/etc/sysctl.d/&lt;/code>，加固一份、性能一份：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
